#: ../../source/user_guide/playback.rst:4 e381637c162740aba863f97e75e8af6c
msgid "播放控制"
msgstr "Playback Control"

#: ../../source/user_guide/playback.rst:6 64f9da41733b4bf584c02b681eb663a4
msgid "本章讲“怎样把声音播出来，以及播出来以后怎样控制它”。"
msgstr "This chapter explains how to play sounds and how to control them after they start playing."

#: ../../source/user_guide/playback.rst:8 511491d054774e05928b14fca7b30792
msgid ""
"刚开始使用时，优先用播放节点。只有当你需要更细的控制，例如一次性创建 :ref:`Sound<glossary-sound>`、拿到 :ref:`Channel<glossary-"
"channel>`、手动设置循环点或 3D 属性时，再使用代码播放。"
msgstr ""
"When you are getting started, prefer playback nodes. Use code-driven playback only when you need "
"finer control, such as creating a :ref:`Sound<glossary-sound>` yourself, getting a :ref:`Channel"
"<glossary-channel>`, or manually setting loop points or 3D properties."

#: ../../source/user_guide/playback.rst:11 507db87102f94561abb7a471f584bbb7
msgid "先选哪种播放方式"
msgstr "Choose a Playback Method First"

#: ../../source/user_guide/playback.rst:16 3872f00592b3429f97598749c0e44fec
msgid "需求"
msgstr "Need"

#: ../../source/user_guide/playback.rst:17 10243c10dca143f7ba4e0ae7a9a1cc7a
msgid "推荐方式"
msgstr "Recommended approach"

#: ../../source/user_guide/playback.rst:18 2978394a816f4239b7955b780ee38910
msgid "背景音乐、长音频、场景里的固定播放器"
msgstr "Background music, long audio, or a fixed player in a scene"

#: ../../source/user_guide/playback.rst:19 1d85a749c417440abefbd8975f6a3643
msgid ":ref:`FmodAudioStreamPlayer<class_FmodAudioStreamPlayer>`"
msgstr ":ref:`FmodAudioStreamPlayer<class_FmodAudioStreamPlayer>`"

#: ../../source/user_guide/playback.rst:20 fb8bb5a61445430890f9593c4562a3f7
msgid "2D 场景里的音效"
msgstr "Sound effects in a 2D scene"

#: ../../source/user_guide/playback.rst:21 94771b599bb74f0fb6134721ec939f2d
msgid ":ref:`FmodAudioStreamPlayer2D<class_FmodAudioStreamPlayer2D>`"
msgstr ":ref:`FmodAudioStreamPlayer2D<class_FmodAudioStreamPlayer2D>`"

