msgid "同一个短音效频繁触发"
msgstr "The same short sound effect is triggered frequently"

#: ../../source/user_guide/playback.rst:25 79e041e96d104117917378eabc434318
msgid "预加载 :ref:`音频资产<glossary-audio-asset>`，或复用 :ref:`Sound<glossary-sound>`"
msgstr "Preload the :ref:`Audio Asset<glossary-audio-asset>` or reuse a :ref:`Sound<glossary-sound>`"

#: ../../source/user_guide/playback.rst:26 dc93800891d34007b29192b6836ffa36
msgid "播放后还要精细控制"
msgstr "Fine-grained control is needed after playback starts"

#: ../../source/user_guide/playback.rst:27 3d998d8905474627ba02afac0c9a1683
msgid "取得 :ref:`Channel<glossary-channel>`"
msgstr "Get the :ref:`Channel<glossary-channel>`"

#: ../../source/user_guide/playback.rst:29 b49e0c4c8e964d3d8bd17fbc94ee98c3
msgid "如果你不确定，先用节点。节点能处理大多数播放、停止、音量、音高和总线路由需求。"
msgstr ""
"If you are not sure, start with nodes. Nodes cover most needs for playback, stopping, volume, "
"pitch, and bus routing."

#: ../../source/user_guide/playback.rst:32 d4edb636d61d494cbb1a128f4ab91b83
msgid "用节点播放"
msgstr "Play with Nodes"

#: ../../source/user_guide/playback.rst:34 aff18fc465914ef4ba10f4b3defb5e96
msgid "最常见的写法是给节点设置 ``stream``，然后调用 ``play()``。"
msgstr "The most common approach is to set the node's ``stream`` and then call ``play()``."

#: ../../source/user_guide/playback.rst:36 a6226cea0f874915a1a02b11d5b17e21
msgid ""
"extends Node\n"
"\n"
"@onready var music := $FmodAudioStreamPlayer\n"
"\n"
"func _ready():\n"
"    var stream := FmodAudioStream.new()\n"
"    stream.file_path = \"res://music/bgm.mp3\"\n"
"\n"
"    music.stream = stream\n"
"    music.bus = \"Music\"\n"
"\n"
"func play_music():\n"
"    music.play()\n"
"\n"
"func stop_music():\n"
"    music.stop()"
msgstr ""
"extends Node\n"
"\n"
"@onready var music := $FmodAudioStreamPlayer\n"
"\n"
"func _ready():\n"
"    var stream := FmodAudioStream.new()\n"
"    stream.file_path = \"res://music/bgm.mp3\"\n"
"\n"
"    music.stream = stream\n"
"    music.bus = \"Music\"\n"
"\n"
"func play_music():\n"
"    music.play()\n"
"\n"
"func stop_music():\n"
"    music.stop()"

#: ../../source/user_guide/playback.rst:55 8cb7d92ee54c4661a3881e3e4789a858
msgid ""
"这里的 ``stream`` 是 Godot-FmodPlayer 的音频资源。底层真正交给 FMOD 播放时，会创建 :ref:`Sound<glossary-"
"sound>`，播放出来的一次声音会对应一个 :ref:`Channel<glossary-channel>`。"
msgstr ""
"Here, ``stream`` is a Godot-FmodPlayer audio resource. When it is handed to FMOD for playback, a "
":ref:`Sound<glossary-sound>` is created under the hood, and each playback instance corresponds to"
" a :ref:`Channel<glossary-channel>`."

#: ../../source/user_guide/playback.rst:58 f248f23e0d054c2aa6e34c2ddd05d0da
msgid "常用节点属性"
msgstr "Common Node Properties"

#: ../../source/user_guide/playback.rst:63 51b013e1db9d487eacfa8326c7be073d
