msgstr "Fade In and Fade Out"

#: ../../source/user_guide/playback.rst:81 4f08727b1d004896873e618f466ecc18
msgid "节点是 Godot 节点，可以直接用 Tween："
msgstr "Because playback nodes are Godot nodes, you can use Tween directly:"

#: ../../source/user_guide/playback.rst:83 29e48ea3a21b468199978ebe9c4e455c
msgid ""
"@onready var music: FmodAudioStreamPlayer = $FmodAudioStreamPlayer\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"func fade_music(target_db: float, duration: float) -> void:\n"
"    var tween: Tween = create_tween()\n"
"    tween.tween_property(music, \"volume_db\", target_db, duration)"
msgstr ""
"@onready var music: FmodAudioStreamPlayer = $FmodAudioStreamPlayer\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"func fade_music(target_db: float, duration: float) -> void:\n"
"    var tween: Tween = create_tween()\n"
"    tween.tween_property(music, \"volume_db\", target_db, duration)"

#: ../../source/user_guide/playback.rst:93 011822445d6042e8bb7809842632e4ed
msgid "播放一次短音效"
msgstr "Play a Short Sound Effect Once"

#: ../../source/user_guide/playback.rst:95 6008b210ebca4195b9de0820eb3a7ab1
msgid "如果只是“按按钮、开枪、拾取物品”这种一次性短音效，可以放一个播放器节点，然后反复调用 ``play()``："
msgstr ""
"For one-shot sound effects such as pressing a button, firing a weapon, or picking up an item, you"
" can place a player node and call ``play()`` repeatedly:"

#: ../../source/user_guide/playback.rst:97 3455e1da1b7d48aea2e34e838e5e24d1
msgid ""
"extends Node\n"
"\n"
"@onready var hit := $HitPlayer\n"
"\n"
"func _ready():\n"
"    var stream := FmodAudioStream.new()\n"
"    stream.file_path = \"res://sfx/hit.wav\"\n"
"    hit.stream = stream\n"
"    hit.bus = \"SFX\"\n"
"\n"
"func play_hit():\n"
"    hit.play()"
msgstr ""
"extends Node\n"
"\n"
"@onready var hit := $HitPlayer\n"
"\n"
"func _ready():\n"
"    var stream := FmodAudioStream.new()\n"
"    stream.file_path = \"res://sfx/hit.wav\"\n"
"    hit.stream = stream\n"
"    hit.bus = \"SFX\"\n"
"\n"
"func play_hit():\n"
"    hit.play()"

#: ../../source/user_guide/playback.rst:112 0e8831e23b484d1a916352bfdd6251af
msgid "如果同一个声音可能重叠播放很多次，例如一秒内触发多发子弹，建议考虑代码播放或对象池，避免一个节点来不及处理所有重叠声音。"
msgstr ""
"If the same sound may overlap many times, such as several bullets fired in one second, consider "
"code-driven playback or an object pool so one node does not have to handle every overlapping "
"instance."

#: ../../source/user_guide/playback.rst:115 c0bb1800a2bb45cabee75b5f466fda6b
msgid "用代码播放"
msgstr "Play from Code"

#: ../../source/user_guide/playback.rst:117 497e5d670fa84eb29f3e0aa47b2637e9
msgid "代码播放会更接近 FMOD 的工作方式："
msgstr "Code-driven playback is closer to how FMOD works:"

#: ../../source/user_guide/playback.rst:119 a63fd9662bfa4e4e962a2806e3bb5ae6
msgid "用 :ref:`System<glossary-system>` 创建 :ref:`Sound<glossary-sound>`。"
msgstr "Create a :ref:`Sound<glossary-sound>` with the :ref:`System<glossary-system>`."

#: ../../source/user_guide/playback.rst:120 838b320c6a384bad9eae1194e7f169fd
msgid "选择输出到哪个 :ref:`Bus<glossary-bus>` / :ref:`ChannelGroup<glossary-channelgroup>`。"
msgstr "Choose which :ref:`Bus<glossary-bus>` / :ref:`ChannelGroup<glossary-channelgroup>` to output to."

#: ../../source/user_guide/playback.rst:121 5a1d6bdbd62d4db18bc0c485064aa4eb
msgid "调用 ``play_sound()``，得到这次播放的 :ref:`Channel<glossary-channel>`。"
msgstr "Call ``play_sound()`` to get the :ref:`Channel<glossary-channel>` for this playback instance."

#: ../../source/user_guide/playback.rst:123 2494d3bf5c2547558d03ccffe5db2af5
msgid ""
"func play_sound(path: String, bus_name: String = \"SFX\") -> FmodChannel:\n"
"    var system := FmodServer.get_main_system()\n"
"\n"
"    var sound := system.create_sound_from_file(path)\n"
"    var runtime_bus: FmodAudioBus = FmodServer.get_audio_bus(StringName(bus_name))\n"
"    var bus: FmodChannelGroup = runtime_bus.get_bus() if runtime_bus != null else "
"FmodServer.get_master_channel_group()\n"
"    var channel := system.play_sound(sound, bus, false)\n"
"\n"
"    return channel"
msgstr ""
"func play_sound(path: String, bus_name: String = \"SFX\") -> FmodChannel:\n"
"    var system := FmodServer.get_main_system()\n"
"\n"
"    var sound := system.create_sound_from_file(path)\n"
"    var runtime_bus: FmodAudioBus = FmodServer.get_audio_bus(StringName(bus_name))\n"
"    var bus: FmodChannelGroup = runtime_bus.get_bus() if runtime_bus != null else "
"FmodServer.get_master_channel_group()\n"
"    var channel := system.play_sound(sound, bus, false)\n"
"\n"
"    return channel"

#: ../../source/user_guide/playback.rst:135 188f3b430ef74707bd629a84f280c54b
msgid "返回的 ``channel`` 只代表“这一次播放”。同一个 ``sound`` 播放三次，就会有三个不同的 :ref:`Channel<glossary-channel>`。"
msgstr ""
"The returned ``channel`` represents only this one playback instance. If the same ``sound`` is "
"played three times, there will be three different :ref:`Channel<glossary-channel>` objects."

#: ../../source/user_guide/playback.rst:138 9c0a1d9f756045418eff3b0178c0785e
msgid "先暂停再配置"
msgstr "Create Paused, Then Configure"

#: ../../source/user_guide/playback.rst:140 f9fc6d1f1fcd403f8b20904b346ff7d4
msgid "有时你希望声音开始前先设置音量、音高或 3D 位置。可以让它以暂停状态创建，配置完成后再恢复："
msgstr ""
"Sometimes you need to set volume, pitch, or 3D position before the sound starts. Create it "
"paused, configure it, and then resume playback:"

#: ../../source/user_guide/playback.rst:142 a81a7c71a5fe4d29ae81cb27e5097e6c
msgid ""
"func play_configured(path: String) -> FmodChannel:\n"
"    var system := FmodServer.get_main_system()\n"
"    var sound := system.create_sound_from_file(path)\n"
"    var runtime_bus: FmodAudioBus = FmodServer.get_audio_bus(&\"SFX\")\n"
"    var sfx_bus: FmodChannelGroup = runtime_bus.get_bus() if runtime_bus != null else "
"FmodServer.get_master_channel_group()\n"
"\n"
"    var channel := system.play_sound(sound, sfx_bus, true)\n"
"    channel.volume_db = -6.0\n"
"    channel.pitch = 1.2\n"
"    channel.set_paused(false)\n"
"\n"
"    return channel"
msgstr ""
"func play_configured(path: String) -> FmodChannel:\n"
"    var system := FmodServer.get_main_system()\n"
"    var sound := system.create_sound_from_file(path)\n"
"    var runtime_bus: FmodAudioBus = FmodServer.get_audio_bus(&\"SFX\")\n"
"    var sfx_bus: FmodChannelGroup = runtime_bus.get_bus() if runtime_bus != null else "
"FmodServer.get_master_channel_group()\n"
"\n"
"    var channel := system.play_sound(sound, sfx_bus, true)\n"
"    channel.volume_db = -6.0\n"
"    channel.pitch = 1.2\n"
"    channel.set_paused(false)\n"
"\n"
"    return channel"

#: ../../source/user_guide/playback.rst:158 5cdafa0bdefa40c4a9725a4fc1c5aa15
msgid "控制一次播放"
msgstr "Control One Playback Instance"

#: ../../source/user_guide/playback.rst:160 c0a5e2081eb44a9bbc1c65fab3c0f108
msgid ":ref:`Channel<glossary-channel>` 是“一次正在播放的声音”。它可以暂停、停止、调音量、调音高、跳转位置，也可以设置 3D 属性。"
msgstr ""
"A :ref:`Channel<glossary-channel>` is one currently playing sound. It can be paused, stopped, "
"have its volume and pitch adjusted, seek to a position, and receive 3D properties."

#: ../../source/user_guide/playback.rst:163 04d63f7a75154501af660de9ec36677c
msgid "暂停、恢复和停止"
msgstr "Pause, Resume, and Stop"

#: ../../source/user_guide/playback.rst:165 d41e7e16a1204159ad2ff29e527bf6d0
msgid ""
"func pause_channel(channel: FmodChannel, paused: bool):\n"
"    if channel != null:\n"
"        channel.set_paused(paused)\n"
"\n"
"func stop_channel(channel: FmodChannel):\n"
"    if channel != null:\n"
"        channel.stop()\n"
"\n"
"func is_still_playing(channel: FmodChannel) -> bool:\n"
"    return channel != null and channel.is_playing()"
msgstr ""
"func pause_channel(channel: FmodChannel, paused: bool):\n"
"    if channel != null:\n"
"        channel.set_paused(paused)\n"
"\n"
"func stop_channel(channel: FmodChannel):\n"
"    if channel != null:\n"
"        channel.stop()\n"
"\n"
"func is_still_playing(channel: FmodChannel) -> bool:\n"
"    return channel != null and channel.is_playing()"

#: ../../source/user_guide/playback.rst:179 104a7ca4ed3744bd95f489ad23a8737f
msgid "音量、音高和声像"
msgstr "Volume, Pitch, and Pan"

#: ../../source/user_guide/playback.rst:181 5bde1871c7b34e2b9a9718d093188aa1
msgid ""
"func adjust_channel(channel: FmodChannel): channel.volume_db = -10.0 channel.pitch = 1.0 # -1.0 "
"in left , 0.0 in , 1.0 in right . channel.set_pan(0.25)"
msgstr ""
"func adjust_channel(channel: FmodChannel): channel.volume_db = -10.0 channel.pitch = 1.0 # -1.0 "
"in left , 0.0 in , 1.0 in right . channel.set_pan(0.25)"

#: ../../source/user_guide/playback.rst:190 5a9615e0589a4bb780f8996fd19cc5ad
msgid "``pitch`` 会同时影响音高和播放速度。``0.5`` 听起来更低也更慢，``2.0`` 听起来更高也更快。"
msgstr ""
"``pitch`` affects both pitch and playback speed. ``0.5`` sounds lower and slower, while ``2.0`` "
"sounds higher and faster."

#: ../../source/user_guide/playback.rst:193 a9c04531f5b1451f83f8ba2d44c57c13
msgid "播放位置"
msgstr "Playback Position"

#: ../../source/user_guide/playback.rst:195 cd3ed2a851234e4692c7f7f647b6d24e
msgid "位置通常用毫秒控制。适合音乐跳转、从某个时间点继续播放，或做简单的预览工具。"
msgstr ""
"Position is usually controlled in milliseconds. This is useful for music seeking, resuming from a"
" specific time, or building a simple preview tool."

#: ../../source/user_guide/playback.rst:197 468f2cc54d374593a958bd9770347774
msgid ""
"func jump_to_30_seconds(channel: FmodChannel):\n"
"    channel.set_position(30000, FmodSystem.FMOD_TIME_UNIT_MS)\n"
"\n"
"func print_position(channel: FmodChannel):\n"
"    var position_ms := channel.get_position(FmodSystem.FMOD_TIME_UNIT_MS)\n"
"    print(\"position: \", position_ms, \" ms\")"
msgstr ""
"func jump_to_30_seconds(channel: FmodChannel):\n"
"    channel.set_position(30000, FmodSystem.FMOD_TIME_UNIT_MS)\n"
"\n"
"func print_position(channel: FmodChannel):\n"
"    var position_ms := channel.get_position(FmodSystem.FMOD_TIME_UNIT_MS)\n"
"    print(\"position: \", position_ms, \" ms\")"

#: ../../source/user_guide/playback.rst:207 965dcea27e4641f390b81d9085919ce8
msgid "循环"
msgstr "Looping"

#: ../../source/user_guide/playback.rst:209 7cb16d00014643589a1166d31031efe2
msgid ""
"func loop_forever(channel: FmodChannel):\n"
"    channel.loop_count = -1\n"
"\n"
"func loop_three_times(channel: FmodChannel):\n"
"    channel.loop_count = 3\n"
"\n"
"func disable_loop(channel: FmodChannel):\n"
"    channel.loop_count = 0"
msgstr ""
"func loop_forever(channel: FmodChannel):\n"
"    channel.loop_count = -1\n"
"\n"
"func loop_three_times(channel: FmodChannel):\n"
"    channel.loop_count = 3\n"
"\n"
"func disable_loop(channel: FmodChannel):\n"
"    channel.loop_count = 0"

#: ../../source/user_guide/playback.rst:220 e1d301ede81a4ca49d26e2be6babc941
msgid ""
"循环是否生效还和创建声音时使用的播放模式有关。常规节点播放通常更适合简单循环；需要精确控制循环点时，再直接控制 :ref:`Channel<glossary-channel>` 和 "
":ref:`Sound<glossary-sound>`。"
msgstr ""
"Whether looping works also depends on the playback mode used when the sound was created. Regular "
"node playback is usually better for simple loops; control :ref:`Channel<glossary-channel>` and "
":ref:`Sound<glossary-sound>` directly only when you need precise loop points."

#: ../../source/user_guide/playback.rst:223 afb20d90dc1e419e9daad70317e5ec53
msgid "2D 与 3D 播放"
msgstr "2D and 3D Playback"

#: ../../source/user_guide/playback.rst:225 9989be47999f44cb98df999ecf9e71b9
msgid "2D 声音不跟随世界位置变化，适合 UI、音乐、旁白。3D 声音会根据 :ref:`Listener<glossary-listener>` 和声源的位置计算距离、方向和衰减。"
msgstr ""
"2D sounds do not follow world positions, so they are suitable for UI, music, and narration. 3D "
"sounds calculate distance, direction, and attenuation from the :ref:`Listener<glossary-listener>`"
" and the sound source position."

#: ../../source/user_guide/playback.rst:228 5588f574dcde47c9bafa1ba6a0b04874
msgid "优先使用 3D 播放节点"
msgstr "Prefer the 3D Playback Node"

#: ../../source/user_guide/playback.rst:230 a41d48e9ac794798b3d7a7431ea59446
msgid "在 3D 场景里，最简单的方式是使用 :ref:`FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D<class_FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D>`。它会把节点位置同步给 FMOD。"
msgstr ""
"In a 3D scene, the simplest approach is to use "
":ref:`FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D<class_FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D>`. It synchronizes the node position "
"to FMOD."

#: ../../source/user_guide/playback.rst:232 3cbf3197af8e4b2b877b6155cf88da0c
msgid ""
"extends Node3D\n"
"\n"
"@onready var emitter := $FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D\n"
"\n"
"func play_at_current_position():\n"
"    emitter.bus = \"SFX\"\n"
"    emitter.play()"
msgstr ""
"extends Node3D\n"
"\n"
"@onready var emitter := $FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D\n"
"\n"
"func play_at_current_position():\n"
"    emitter.bus = \"SFX\"\n"
"    emitter.play()"

#: ../../source/user_guide/playback.rst:242 fbcafdd07355423cb89cb725a183cf18
msgid "如果声音应该跟随敌人、车辆、门、机关或环境物件，就把播放器作为这些节点的子节点。"
msgstr ""
"If a sound should follow an enemy, vehicle, door, mechanism, or environment object, make the "
"player a child of that node."

#: ../../source/user_guide/playback.rst:245 fbf0739556634ff5aa37c51158e0e989
msgid "代码方式设置 3D 位置"
msgstr "Set 3D Position from Code"

#: ../../source/user_guide/playback.rst:247 01957782ee4b48b98c0537915cd8fef6
msgid "只有在你直接代码播放时，才需要手动设置 3D 属性："
msgstr "You only need to set 3D properties manually when playing directly from code:"

#: ../../source/user_guide/playback.rst:249 a2033b3cf10648579f2ce7cfd0050d8c
msgid ""
"func play_3d_sound(path: String, position: Vector3):\n"
"    var system := FmodServer.get_main_system()\n"
"    var sound := system.create_sound_from_file(path, FmodSystem.FMOD_MODE_3D)\n"
"    var runtime_bus: FmodAudioBus = FmodServer.get_audio_bus(&\"SFX\")\n"
"    var bus: FmodChannelGroup = runtime_bus.get_bus() if runtime_bus != null else "
"FmodServer.get_master_channel_group()\n"
"\n"
"    var channel := system.play_sound(sound, bus, true)\n"
"    channel.set_3d_attributes(position, Vector3.ZERO)\n"
"    channel.set_3d_min_max_distance(1.0, 30.0)\n"
"    channel.set_paused(false)\n"
"\n"
"    return channel"
msgstr ""
"func play_3d_sound(path: String, position: Vector3):\n"
"    var system := FmodServer.get_main_system()\n"
"    var sound := system.create_sound_from_file(path, FmodSystem.FMOD_MODE_3D)\n"
"    var runtime_bus: FmodAudioBus = FmodServer.get_audio_bus(&\"SFX\")\n"
"    var bus: FmodChannelGroup = runtime_bus.get_bus() if runtime_bus != null else "
"FmodServer.get_master_channel_group()\n"
"\n"
"    var channel := system.play_sound(sound, bus, true)\n"
"    channel.set_3d_attributes(position, Vector3.ZERO)\n"
"    channel.set_3d_min_max_distance(1.0, 30.0)\n"
"    channel.set_paused(false)\n"
"\n"
"    return channel"

#: ../../source/user_guide/playback.rst:264 44d881fb34ef40a89a383f17c811357d
msgid "这里的 ``FMOD_MODE_3D`` 很重要。没有用 3D 模式创建的声音，即使设置了位置，也不会按 3D 声源来计算。"
msgstr ""
"``FMOD_MODE_3D`` is important here. If a sound was not created in 3D mode, setting a position "
"will not make it behave as a 3D sound source."

#: ../../source/user_guide/playback.rst:267 45abb4e4e0034f7a98a7979dd59ad24b
msgid "监听器"
msgstr "Listener"

#: ../../source/user_guide/playback.rst:269 61e5f7301ea54285bd9e54305199b2c9
msgid ":ref:`Listener<glossary-listener>` 表示玩家“从哪里听”。通常它跟随玩家角色或主摄像机。"
msgstr ""
"The :ref:`Listener<glossary-listener>` represents where the player hears from. It usually follows"
" the player character or the main camera."

#: ../../source/user_guide/playback.rst:271 1c97af6742c749348ed232cee459c673
msgid ""
"extends CharacterBody3D\n"
"\n"
"func _physics_process(_delta):\n"
"    var system := FmodServer.get_main_system()\n"
"    system.set_3d_listener_attributes(\n"
"        0,\n"
"        global_position,\n"
"        velocity,\n"
"        -global_transform.basis.z,\n"
"        global_transform.basis.y\n"
"    )"
msgstr ""
"extends CharacterBody3D\n"
"\n"
"func _physics_process(_delta):\n"
"    var system := FmodServer.get_main_system()\n"
"    system.set_3d_listener_attributes(\n"
"        0,\n"
"        global_position,\n"
"        velocity,\n"
"        -global_transform.basis.z,\n"
"        global_transform.basis.y\n"
"    )"

#: ../../source/user_guide/playback.rst:285 09b63d45610847088a8e34be53c4a72b
msgid "如果 3D 声音听起来方向不对、距离不对，先检查监听器位置和朝向。"
msgstr ""
"If a 3D sound has the wrong direction or distance, check the listener position and orientation "
"first."

#: ../../source/user_guide/playback.rst:288 0f151d0c2ccc4b6a9bea43c12e489589
msgid "常见问题"
msgstr "FAQ"

#: ../../source/user_guide/playback.rst:291 6a62fa1e11e54eaaa6bd9b772abb7540
msgid "声音没有播放"
msgstr "The Sound Does Not Play"

#: ../../source/user_guide/playback.rst:293 72d6f823b762457fac6c425be45c7db3
msgid "按顺序检查："
msgstr "Check these in order:"

#: ../../source/user_guide/playback.rst:295 93159e8bdf3643a3bba10dea25bbcdca
msgid "音频路径是否正确。"
msgstr "Whether the audio path is correct."

#: ../../source/user_guide/playback.rst:296 788ac540d0f4419e88c4de4627568f0e
msgid "播放节点是否有 ``stream``。"
msgstr "Whether the playback node has a ``stream``."

#: ../../source/user_guide/playback.rst:297 ae423753e4174483af2eaafb6ec1fcc0
msgid "目标 :ref:`Bus<glossary-bus>` 是否存在，是否被静音。"
msgstr "Whether the target :ref:`Bus<glossary-bus>` exists and is not muted."

#: ../../source/user_guide/playback.rst:298 aabeb6dd123045168626eb875994e353
msgid "音量是否太低。"
msgstr "Whether the volume is too low."

#: ../../source/user_guide/playback.rst:299 97f3d3ef9ea3441fb5c7c84e8dc4f8c0
msgid "3D 声音是否离 :ref:`Listener<glossary-listener>` 太远。"
msgstr "Whether the 3D sound is too far away from the :ref:`Listener<glossary-listener>`."

#: ../../source/user_guide/playback.rst:302 f3103466556640f4a30196746e91b4ff
msgid "声音只能播放一次"
msgstr "The Sound Only Plays Once"

#: ../../source/user_guide/playback.rst:304 5c4a28c0c2634c67922dc1a81c1ae51a
msgid ""
"如果同一个节点还在播放，再调用 ``play()`` 可能会重启这一次播放，而不是创建新的重叠声音。需要重叠播放时，可以创建多个播放器、使用对象池，或直接用 ``play_sound()`` "
"获取多个 :ref:`Channel<glossary-channel>`。"
msgstr ""
"If the same node is still playing, calling ``play()`` again may restart that playback instead of "
"creating a new overlapping sound. For overlapping playback, create multiple players, use an "
"object pool, or call ``play_sound()`` directly to obtain multiple :ref:`Channel<glossary-"
"channel>` objects."

#: ../../source/user_guide/playback.rst:307 6b7c8a96a0664bfa9444a1c35bcfb870
msgid "大量声音时卡顿"
msgstr "Stutter When Playing Many Sounds"

#: ../../source/user_guide/playback.rst:309 d5d074a4e13d47c7bc2a46bbcadae899
msgid "短音效可以优先用 Sample 方式或预加载；长音乐优先用 Stream 方式。两者的区别见 :ref:`Stream 与 Sample<glossary-stream-sample>`。"
msgstr ""
"For short sound effects, prefer Sample mode or preloading. For long music, prefer Stream mode. "
"See :ref:`Stream and Sample<glossary-stream-sample>` for the difference."

#: ../../source/user_guide/playback.rst:311 ff995f28f988476b93f048cfd39c89e2
msgid ""
"同时播放很多声音时，也可以关注 :ref:`Virtual Channel<glossary-virtual-channel>`。FMOD "
"可能会让听不见或优先级低的声音进入虚拟状态，以减少混音开销。"
msgstr ""
"When many sounds play at once, also pay attention to :ref:`Virtual Channel<glossary-virtual-"
"channel>`. FMOD may virtualize inaudible or low-priority sounds to reduce mixing cost."

#: ../../source/user_guide/playback.rst:314 c600a1ec61cf466a97996e2c92af62cb
msgid "建议"
msgstr "Recommendations"

#: ../../source/user_guide/playback.rst:316 2a1a5052aa2144edb125e4a9736e8b67
msgid "入门先用播放节点，不要一开始就直接操作底层对象。"
msgstr "Start with playback nodes. Do not operate on lower-level objects right away."

#: ../../source/user_guide/playback.rst:317 ec1221a6624d480bb0f74e0a030ba54f
msgid "需要控制“这一次播放”时，再拿 :ref:`Channel<glossary-channel>`。"
msgstr "Get a :ref:`Channel<glossary-channel>` when you need to control this specific playback instance."

#: ../../source/user_guide/playback.rst:318 51eb29c0ebd94e32aeba20f04ebf7592
msgid "长音乐走 ``Music`` 总线，短音效走 ``SFX`` 总线。"
msgstr "Route long music to the ``Music`` bus and short sound effects to the ``SFX`` bus."

#: ../../source/user_guide/playback.rst:319 6673560cb0194a17b34ba262223bc482
msgid "3D 声音优先用 :ref:`FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D<class_FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D>`。"
msgstr "Prefer :ref:`FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D<class_FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D>` for 3D sounds."

#: ../../source/user_guide/playback.rst:320 a6bbe11017a74b8fae9ef5ea1205c65a
msgid "代码播放时，如果要先配置参数，就用暂停状态创建，再恢复播放。"
msgstr ""
"When playing from code, create the sound paused if you need to configure parameters first, then "
"resume playback."
